  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'INCIDENT NIGHT



    DATE: 14 OCTOBER

    TIME: 11:42 PM

    LOCATION:
    NORTH WING



    The incident was first reported late at night.



    Security
    cameras recorded unusual movement

    around the north wing of the building.



    At
    approximately 11:42 PM, the lights in the

    corridor suddenly went out.



    A
    witness reported hearing a loud sound

    coming from inside the room.



    The
    security system registered movement

    inside the building.



    No one was
    seen leaving the building

    immediately after the incident.



    The camera
    footage became unavailable

    for approximately three minutes.



    When
    the system came back online,

    the corridor was empty.



    Further investigation
    was required.



    END OF REPORT'
